    "description": "NixOS Package PRs for plasma-systemmonitor, networkmanager-1.42.6, ark, cups-pk-helper, clion-with-plugins, xrdb packages on GitHub",
    "items": [
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6779172?u=d97eb37f2645fa4fc54ff43b09b7f2d12d2d5d13&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">cosmic-comp</code> sets the cursor size and theme for X11 clients by spawning <code class=\"notranslate\">xrdb -merge</code> on the Xwayland display (<code class=\"notranslate\">src/xwayland.rs</code>, <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3797786120\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-comp/issues/1976\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/pop-os/cosmic-comp/pull/1976/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-comp/pull/1976\">pop-os/cosmic-comp#1976</a>). The nixpkgs package does not put <code class=\"notranslate\">xrdb</code> on the compositor's <code class=\"notranslate\">PATH</code>, so it logs <code class=\"notranslate\">`xrdb` not found, cannot update Xresources.</code> at Xwayland start and X11 clients (Steam, Wine/Proton games) render oversized cursors. This adds <code class=\"notranslate\">xrdb</code> to the wrapper's <code class=\"notranslate\">PATH</code>, the same way <code class=\"notranslate\">cosmic-greeter</code> gets <code class=\"notranslate\">cosmic-randr</code> (<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3484792178\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/448844\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/448844/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/pull/448844\">#448844</a>).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #565127.\">Resolves</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5515692462\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/565127\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/565127/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/issues/565127\">#565127</a></p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Things done</h2>\n\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li>Built on platform:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> x86_64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-linux</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> aarch64-darwin</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Tested, as applicable:\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://nixos.org/manual/nixos/unstable/index.html#sec-nixos-tests\" rel=\"nofollow\">NixOS tests</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/nixos/tests\">nixos/tests</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md#package-tests\">Package tests</a> at <code class=\"notranslate\">passthru.tests</code>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Tests in <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/lib/tests\">lib/tests</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/test\">pkgs/test</a> for functions and \"core\" functionality.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Ran <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> on this PR. See <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review#usage\">nixpkgs-review usage</a>.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Tested basic functionality of all binary files, usually in <code class=\"notranslate\">./result/bin/</code>.</li>\n<li>Nixpkgs Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Package update: when the change is major or breaking.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>NixOS Release Notes\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module addition: when adding a new NixOS module.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Module update: when the change is significant.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Fits <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md\">CONTRIBUTING.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/pkgs/README.md\">pkgs/README.md</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/master/maintainers/README.md\">maintainers/README.md</a> and other READMEs.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Follows the <a href=\"https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/maste